        ],
        "text": "JUSTICE THOMAS: General Sauer, the \u2014 these universal injunctions, as you say, have proliferated over the last three decades or so. Would you discuss, though, the origins of universal injunctions?"
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Sotomayor",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "f96a441c2d484a57cd3055a83ddee3cda1c55c285ecfb99b57c629f5caecbe76",
