              "ev-f96a441c2d48-0000-0005"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 8,
              "start": 8
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Justice Sotomayor, jUSTICE SOTOMAYOR: I'm sorry. ... Does citizenship mean are you born in the territory of the United States, or does it mean are you loyal to someone else ...?"
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice GORSUCH",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "f96a441c2d484a57cd3055a83ddee3cda1c55c285ecfb99b57c629f5caecbe76",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-f96a441c2d48-0001-0000"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 25,
              "start": 25
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Justice GORSUCH, well, what do you say, though, to the suggestion that the patchwork problems for the government and plaintiffs justify broader relief?"
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice THOMAS",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "f96a441c2d484a57cd3055a83ddee3cda1c55c285ecfb99b57c629f5caecbe76",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-f96a441c2d48-0001-0004"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 38,
              "start": 38
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Justice THOMAS, general, when were the first universal injunctions used?"
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Thomas",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "f96a441c2d484a57cd3055a83ddee3cda1c55c285ecfb99b57c629f5caecbe76",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-f96a441c2d48-0005-0001"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 128,
              "start": 128
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Justice Thomas, you say the government is wrong about the availability of preliminary injunctions. On what do you base that?"
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Kavanaugh",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "f96a441c2d484a57cd3055a83ddee3cda1c55c285ecfb99b57c629f5caecbe76",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-f96a441c2d48-0007-0000"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 151,
              "start": 151
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Justice Kavanaugh, some of your concerns about this Court being involved, I guess I'm not sure I really understand that."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Gorsuch",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "f96a441c2d484a57cd3055a83ddee3cda1c55c285ecfb99b57c629f5caecbe76",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-f96a441c2d48-0004-0000"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 88,
              "start": 88
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Justice Gorsuch, you don't get to squiggle out into the first bucket, okay? We're in the third bucket."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "States",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "f96a441c2d484a57cd3055a83ddee3cda1c55c285ecfb99b57c629f5caecbe76",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-f96a441c2d48-0004-0001"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 88,
              "start": 88
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to States, which is I think it requires having district courts consider the availability of the alternative and explaining why it's not workable in the case."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Jackson",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "fb37a04b11076b76687f6970fbcc6672693c2d9a8f7115cee4ab8eb3c2bf008a",
